YOUR MISSION

Build GoldPrism as a complete, professional, production-minded MCX gold intelligence and trading execution platform. The goal is to transform raw commodity market data into explainable analysis, validated trading opportunities, risk-controlled order execution, and transparent performance monitoring.

IMPORTANT: Build the complete application, not just a landing page or static UI mockup. Every major button, navigation item, chart, filter, form, dashboard panel, and workflow must work. Use real calculations and connected backend services wherever possible. Clearly label simulated data and never present mock results as actual market data or verified trading performance.

If an existing project or repository is available, inspect it first. Preserve all existing features, content, routes, components, styles, and working functionality. Do not delete or replace existing work unnecessarily. Integrate and improve it incrementally. If starting from zero, create the complete application architecture.

==================================================
1. PRODUCT VISION
==================================================

GoldPrism is not another generic stock-trading dashboard.

It is a specialized, explainable commodity derivatives intelligence platform focused initially on the MCX gold contract family.

Its core workflow is:

Market Data → Data Validation → Contract Normalization → Spread Analysis → X-Ray Decomposition → Signal Validation → Transaction Costs → Risk Checks → Trade/No-Trade Decision → Paper/Live Execution → Monitoring → Performance Analytics.

The central philosophy is:

“Explain every trading decision. Prove the edge. Know when NOT to trade.”

The platform must support research, decision support, paper trading, broker-connected manual execution, and a carefully controlled path toward automated execution.

